    "full_physical_facets": {
      "technology": {
        "technologicalApplicability": [
          {
            "#text": "Reusable material or waste interface. Each Process declares composition, reference-volume conditions, density and fate, then selects compatible geographic providers. This technical reference documents assumptions and does not certify a measured supplier specification.",
            "@xml:lang": "en"
          },
          {
            "#text": "可复用物料或废物接口。各过程须披露组成、参考体积条件、密度及去向，并选择匹配的地域供应过程。所引技术来源记录假设，不认证供应商实测规格。",
